WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.620
Sima Qian traveled through the countryside, asking elders about ancient history and carefully taking notes.

00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:11.200
At the Han court, he bravely stood up to defend Li Ling, without any fear.

00:00:11.640 --> 00:00:18.380
After his punishment, he sat alone in a simple room — in pain, yet with resolve in his eyes, gripping his brush tightly.

00:00:18.820 --> 00:00:25.460
In the middle of the night, in the warm lamplight, he wrote without stopping on bamboo slips, recording history character by character.

00:00:25.460 --> 00:00:32.780
Stack after stack of finished bamboo slips piled higher and higher around him — and at last he completed this great work.

00:00:32.780 --> 00:00:48.340
Sunlight fell on the bamboo slips covered with writing; Sima Qian quietly looked at his work, calm and proud. Later generations called this work the Shiji, the Records of the Grand Historian — and it has been handed down generation after generation.

